  "reasoning": "The defendant deceived the victim by pretending to seek a marriage partner, arranged a fake mother, and used the victim's trust to transfer the victim's bank funds to his own account and obtain a gold ring. This constitutes obtaining property by fraudulent means, i.e., fraud. No other distinct illegal acts (e.g., illegal marriage, kidnapping, etc.) are present. Therefore the appropriate charge is 诈骗.",
  "final_answer": "诈骗"
